+    PocketParams, PocketStrategy, Side, SlotParams, adaptive_trochoidal, bore, circular, contour,
+    cut_levels, cut_levels_for, equal_stepdown, pocket, pocket_avoid_with_relief,
+    pocket_relief_plan, slot,
